{"4682440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aquasim", "steam_appid": 4682440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AquaSim</strong> is a cozy, living aquarium that stays with you while you use your computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/d947b7c93fbbc9d3df330981d8769541.avif?t=1785258098\" width=1186 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stress. No pressure. Just a peaceful world quietly evolving on your screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/b5b95d9eaa745f65c3190bc8794278b0.poster.avif?t=1785258098\" width=308 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/b5b95d9eaa745f65c3190bc8794278b0.webm?t=1785258098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/b5b95d9eaa745f65c3190bc8794278b0.mp4?t=1785258098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AquaSim is designed as a desktop companion, something you don’t “play” constantly, but something that lives alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study, work, or relax while your fish grow, interact, and create a living ecosystem in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/3ecbf35d4ea258da6cd53d4291e7d68c.poster.avif?t=1785258098\" width=406 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/3ecbf35d4ea258da6cd53d4291e7d68c.webm?t=1785258098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/3ecbf35d4ea258da6cd53d4291e7d68c.mp4?t=1785258098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your aquarium at your own pace:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Feed your fish and watch them grow<br>• Clean and maintain water quality<br>• Decorate your tank with meaningful items<br>• Discover new species and rare variations<br>• Observe natural behaviors, interactions, and breeding </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/52a59097a88be13ec4f5a46210572d4d.avif?t=1785258098\" width=1186 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Simulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your aquarium continues evolving even when you're not actively playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breeding</strong><br>Fish reproduce with variation, creating unique and rare outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>140+ Decorations</strong><br>Some objects aren't just visual,  they affect oxygen, happiness, and ecosystem balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bestiary Collection</strong><br>Track species, discover variants, and complete your aquatic collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organic Progression</strong><br>No forced missions, it gently rewards curiosity and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perfect for students, developers, designers, streamers, or anyone who wants a living piece of calm on their desktop.<br>Thank you for checking out AquaSim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AquaSim</strong> is a cozy, living aquarium that stays with you while you use your computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/d947b7c93fbbc9d3df330981d8769541.avif?t=1785258098\" width=1186 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stress. No pressure. Just a peaceful world quietly evolving on your screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/b5b95d9eaa745f65c3190bc8794278b0.poster.avif?t=1785258098\" width=308 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/b5b95d9eaa745f65c3190bc8794278b0.webm?t=1785258098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/extras/b5b95d9eaa745f65c3190bc8794278b0.mp4?t=1785258098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AquaSim is designed as a desktop companion, something you don’t “play” constantly, but something that lives alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study, work, or relax while your fish grow, interact, and create a living ecosystem in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop 