rong><br>No forced missions, it gently rewards curiosity and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perfect for students, developers, designers, streamers, or anyone who wants a living piece of calm on their desktop.<br>Thank you for checking out AquaSim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A relaxing desktop aquarium that lives with you: grow, breed, and watch a peaceful ecosystem evolve in real time.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/8393895ab0bb45196aa248505d007782f3c0938f/header.jpg?t=1785258098", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/b13acb909ef55938a891359f4e7393f73b9e865e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785258098", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682440/b13acb909ef55938a891359f4e7393f73b9e865e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785258098", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Optimized for 1080p.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Optimized 